BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 595 Tm (  still failed too often.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 582 Tm (- The first MathWorks-style narrow run had `FailureRate = 0`, but mean final) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 569 Tm (  theta2 error was still about `30.7 deg`.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 556 Tm (- The detailed 1c runs survived full episodes and reached high average rewards,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 543 Tm (  but learned repeated swinging instead of upright capture.) Tj ET
