BT /F1 8.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 444 Tm (Surviving an episode is not the same as balancing the pendulum.) Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 422 Tm (2. Fixed Evaluation Saved The Project More Than Once) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 403 Tm (What happened:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 386 Tm (- Training traces often looked promising.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 373 Tm (- Fixed-case evaluation exposed arm-limit failures, loose final balance,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 360 Tm (  persistent oscillation, and later the detailed-model survival loophole.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 347 Tm (- The 297-case grid made it possible to compare agents fairly.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 330 Tm (Lesson:) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 313 Tm (Every serious run needs fixed short and full evaluations, not only training) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 302 Tm (reward plots.) Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 280 Tm (3. The Reward Was Often Technically Correct But Practically Weak) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 261 Tm (What happened:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 244 Tm (- In the direct Stage 1 run, the theta2 reward near upright was extremely small.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 231 Tm (- A `0.5 deg` pendulum oscillation cost was almost free relative to survival.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 218 Tm (- Velocity penalties were also tiny compared with alive/upright bonuses.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 205 Tm (- In the detailed model, the alive/survival reward could be exploited by) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 192 Tm (  continuous swinging.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 179 Tm (- A late observed variant was even more concrete: the agent learned to hold or) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 166 Tm (  hover the pendulum around a sideways region with jitter instead of completing) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 153 Tm (  swing-up and capture.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 136 Tm (Lesson:) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 119 Tm (Reward terms must be scaled so the behavior we actually care about is visible) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 108 Tm (to the critic.) Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 86 Tm (4. Do Not Confuse Safety Failure Rate With Control Quality) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 67 Tm (What happened:) Tj ET
