BT /F1 8.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 433 Tm (You can make the deployed actor smaller, but the critic still needs enough) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 422 Tm (capacity to train a useful policy.) Tj ET
