BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 790 Tm (What we learned:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 773 Tm (- Terminal penalties and alive rewards need sane relative scale.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 760 Tm (- Very large unsafe penalties can create harsh critic targets.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 747 Tm (- Very generous survival reward can create a loophole where staying alive is) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 734 Tm (  enough.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 717 Tm (Do:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 700 Tm (- Inspect reward components numerically.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 687 Tm (- Log reward diagnosis signals.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 674 Tm (- Ask whether the reward differentiates "excellent" from "barely acceptable.") Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 657 Tm (Do not:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 640 Tm (- Assume a reward formula is good because it is mathematically reasonable.) Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 616 Tm (Mistake 3 - We Judged Some Runs Too Broadly Or Too Narrowly At First) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 597 Tm (What failed:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 580 Tm (- Stage 1 direct TD3 was evaluated on a broad 297-case swing-up grid even) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 567 Tm (  though it was only trained for near-upright behavior.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 554 Tm (- Conversely, some early training reward/survival looked good until fixed) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 541 Tm (  grids exposed failures.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 524 Tm (What we learned:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 507 Tm (- Evaluation must match the training question.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 494 Tm (- A local-balance stage needs a local-balance grid.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 481 Tm (- A final swing-up controller needs the broad grid.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 464 Tm (Do:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 447 Tm (- Use both task-specific evaluation and final broad evaluation.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 430 Tm (Do not:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 413 Tm (- Declare a local stage useless only because it fails the final full task.) Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 389 Tm (Mistake 4 - Frequent In-Episode TD3 Updates Made Training Painful) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 370 Tm (What failed:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 353 Tm (- With 1 kHz agent rate and `LearningFrequency = 4`, a full 1 s episode could) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 340 Tm (  trigger about `250` learning events.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 327 Tm (- With off-policy mini-batch limits, the option-level upper bound could become) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 314 Tm (  very large.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 301 Tm (- Training slowed as episodes survived longer.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 284 Tm (What we learned:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 267 Tm (- Simulink plant simulation was not the main slowdown; learner updates were.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 254 Tm (- `LearningFrequency = 40` reduced pressure.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 241 Tm (- `LearningFrequency = -1` moved learning to episode end and gave a cleaner) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 228 Tm (  rollout.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 211 Tm (Do:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 194 Tm (- Estimate update counts before long runs.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 177 Tm (Do not:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 160 Tm (- Treat sample time and learning frequency as independent details.) Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 136 Tm (Mistake 4b - We Needed To Understand End-Of-Episode Learning Quantitatively) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 117 Tm (This became important for the `500Hz_long` run because the controller was fast) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 104 Tm (enough and long enough that "one training run" was no longer a small object.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 87 Tm (The key settings from the deployed baseline were:) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 70 Tm (Run: run_20260618_223832_td3_mathworks_style_pi_current_1b_500hz_long) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 59 Tm (Agent sample time: 0.002 s / 500 Hz) Tj ET
