BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 687 Tm (What we learned:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 670 Tm (- Domain randomization is for robustness around a solvable nominal task.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 657 Tm (- It is not a substitute for a reward/observation/model that can solve the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 644 Tm (  base task.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 627 Tm (Do:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 610 Tm (- Add randomization gradually after nominal capture works.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 593 Tm (Do not:) Tj ET
